#### REQ-LENS-009-006: On-Call Schedule Management

**Status**: Mandatory (Phase 2)
**Rationale**: Ensure 24/7 coverage

**Requirements**:
- Primary on-call rotation: Weekly
- Backup on-call: Designated secondary
- Schedule documented in PagerDuty
- On-call handoff: Weekly meeting (Friday 2 PM ET)
- Escalation after 15 minutes if no acknowledgment

**Implementation**:
```hcl
# Terraform - PagerDuty Schedules and Escalation
resource "pagerduty_user" "platform_engineer_1" {
  name  = "Alice Johnson"
  email = "alice.johnson@company.com"
}

resource "pagerduty_user" "platform_engineer_2" {
  name  = "Bob Smith"
  email = "bob.smith@company.com"
}

resource "pagerduty_user" "platform_engineer_3" {
  name  = "Carol Davis"
  email = "carol.davis@company.com"
}

# Primary on-call schedule (weekly rotation)
resource "pagerduty_schedule" "platform_primary" {
  name      = "EaaS Platform - Primary On-Call"
  time_zone = "America/New_York"
  layer {
    name                         = "Weekly Rotation"
    start                        = "2026-01-24T17:00:00-05:00"  # Friday 5 PM ET
    rotation_turn_length_seconds = 604800  # 1 week
    users = [
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_1.id,
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_2.id,
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_3.id
    ]
  }
}

# Backup schedule
resource "pagerduty_schedule" "platform_backup" {
  name      = "EaaS Platform - Backup On-Call"
  time_zone = "America/New_York"
  layer {
    name                         = "Weekly Rotation"
    start                        = "2026-01-24T17:00:00-05:00"
    rotation_turn_length_seconds = 604800
    users = [
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_2.id,
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_3.id,
      pagerduty_user.platform_engineer_1.id  # Offset by 1
    ]
  }
}

# Escalation policy
resource "pagerduty_escalation_policy" "eaas_platform" {
  name      = "EaaS Platform Escalation"
  num_loops = 2
  rule {
    escalation_delay_in_minutes = 0
    target { type = "schedule_reference"; id = pagerduty_schedule.platform_primary.id }
  }
  rule {
    escalation_delay_in_minutes = 15
    target { type = "schedule_reference"; id = pagerduty_schedule.platform_backup.id }
  }
}
```

**On-Call Handoff Process**: Weekly meeting Friday 2 PM ET. Handoff checklist includes reviewing open incidents, known issues, upcoming maintenance, and updating runbooks.
